4625
06:11:59.230 --> 06:12:04.459
You need spaces between elements inside your square brackets. And don't forget the

4626
06:12:04.459 --> 06:12:09.625
semicolon. Let's look at a basic string comparison if statement. This code sets a

4627
06:12:09.625 --> 06:12:14.663
