6686
08:40:03.845 --> 08:40:08.597
made. You would do well to explore the options provided by your version control

6687
08:40:08.597 --> 08:40:13.589
system. The second line of defense is your project's CI-CD pipeline. Let's see what

6688
08:40:13.589 --> 08:40:17.980
that is. CI-CD stands for Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery.

6689
08:40:17.980 --> 08:40:22.810
The first term has come to present the practice of integrating code changes as soon

