6710
08:41:56.663 --> 08:42:01.400
or store it for later use. Now that you know how to run tests automatically, let's

6711
08:42:01.400 --> 08:42:06.022
play with some examples. Congratulations, you made it to the last chapter. We've

6712
08:42:06.022 --> 08:42:10.759
seen how we can ingest data into the data lake, how to clean that data, and create

