7007
09:07:02.685 --> 09:07:07.650
our data than to have it be public by default. If we or our colleague

7008
09:07:07.650 --> 09:07:13.839
tries to download a file with pandas S3 won't let them even if it's in the same

7009
09:07:13.839 --> 09:07:20.420
script that uploaded but if we initialize the S3 client with our credentials it will

7010
09:07:20.420 --> 09:07:26.765
work let's learn how to protect and expose our buckets and objects there are four

7011
09:07:26.765 --> 09:07:33.268
ways we can control permissions in S3 we can use IAM to control users access to AWS

7012
09:07:33.268 --> 09:07:37.420
services buckets and objects we used it in lesson one

