09:10:04.240 --> 09:10:11.876
IAM answers, what can this user do in AWS? Bucket policies answer, who can access

7039
09:10:11.876 --> 09:10:19.701
this S3 bucket? ACLs answer, who can access this object? And pre-signed URLs let us

7040
09:10:19.701 --> 09:10:27.148
grant temporary access to objects. We can set ACLs to public read or private on

7041
09:10:27.148 --> 09:10:34.030
