10043
13:10:15.686 --> 13:10:19.862
processing. Normally in Python and most other languages, variables are fully

10044
13:10:19.862 --> 13:10:24.203
mutable. The values can be changed at any given time, assuming the scope of the

10045
13:10:24.203 --> 13:10:28.818
