10047
13:10:33.324 --> 13:10:37.170
around these issues using constructs like mutexes and semaphores, etc.

10048
13:10:37.170 --> 13:10:41.765
This can add complexity, especially with non-trivial programs. Unlike typical Python

10049
13:10:41.765 --> 13:10:45.704
