10873
14:12:16.740 --> 14:12:22.851
Here is a basic logging setup the level argument of the basic config function sets

10874
14:12:22.851 --> 14:12:28.738
the logging level to info level and has each log message print the time the log

10875
14:12:28.738 --> 14:12:34.923
level of the statement and the message itself note that the first statement printed

