11481
15:04:17.760 --> 15:04:23.312
Let's study how we can detect them. SQL Server doesn't provide a full-blown set of

11482
15:04:23.312 --> 15:04:28.796
regular expressions. Instead, we can match patterns by using the like operator in

11483
15:04:28.796 --> 15:04:34.416
combination with the pattern we want to find. If we want to have the full-blown set

11484
15:04:34.416 --> 15:04:39.629
of regular expressions, we need to create and install extensions for the like

11485
15:04:39.629 --> 15:04:44.775
operator. In this lesson, we will focus on the like operator and the pattern

11486
15:04:44.775 --> 15:04:46.400
matching that it offers.

11487
15:04:46.400 --> 15:04:52.370
SQL Server provides the like operator, which determines if a string matches a

11488
15:04:52.370 --> 15:04:58.727
specified pattern. These are the characters we can use to specify a pattern. The %

11489
15:04:58.727 --> 15:05:05.085
symbol finds any string with zero or more characters. For example, if we write 555

11490
15:05:05.085 --> 15:05:11.210
followed by a hyphen and then the % symbol, we can find any contact number that

11491
15:05:11.210 --> 15:05:12.450
starts with 555.

11492
15:05:12.450 --> 15:05:17.830
Followed by a hyphen and then have zero or more characters. The underscore symbol

11493
15:05:17.830 --> 15:05:23.343
matches any single character. For example, we can specify a pattern to find all the

11494
15:05:23.343 --> 15:05:28.855
contact numbers that have three characters followed by a hyphen, then another three

11495
15:05:28.855 --> 15:05:34.036
characters followed by another hyphen, and finally, four characters. Using the

11496
15:05:34.036 --> 15:05:39.416
brackets, we can find any single character within a specified range or set, as we

11497
15:05:39.416 --> 15:05:41.010
can see in this example.

11498
15:05:41.010 --> 15:05:46.691
Finally, the current symbol negates any single character in the specified range or

11499
15:05:46.691 --> 15:05:51.956
set. Let's demonstrate the use of the like operator in combination with some

11500
15:05:51.956 --> 15:05:57.706
patterns. In this example, with the use of the person symbol, we are trying to find

11501
15:05:57.706 --> 15:06:03.526
