12356
16:17:42.845 --> 16:17:48.361
from the same table. This limitation can be overcome by using triggers. A trigger

12357
16:17:48.361 --> 16:17:53.333
can use columns from other tables as well to calculate values. While this

12358
16:17:53.333 --> 16:17:58.986
