12392
16:20:45.142 --> 16:20:48.320
the products table to the retired products table.

12393
16:20:48.320 --> 16:20:53.673
The trigger should have a uniquely identifying name. For this example, it will be

12394
16:20:53.673 --> 16:20:58.761
