12401
16:21:27.140 --> 16:21:32.708
Delete. And then we start the section that defines the actions to be performed by

12402
16:21:32.708 --> 16:21:38.483
the trigger. Notice that we are not getting the information from the products table,

12403
16:21:38.483 --> 16:21:44.051
but from a table called deleted. DML triggers use two special tables, deleted and

12404
16:21:44.051 --> 16:21:44.670
